    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/e29bab3137188f5ffc9fa6b26ddc5e99.avif?t=1713576050\" /></span><br><br>You always wanted to be a contestant on the hit kids game show &quot;Jungle Jammers&quot;. <br>You've practiced for months.<br>You've learned all the tricks.<br>You've sent in dozens of applications.<br>But you've never been picked.<br><br>Lucky for you, Funset Studios has opened their Studio tour to the public. <br>You're finally going to get the chance to meet your favorite TV Character: Fumbo The Hippo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/f0fc22bbab0d20f8a64dff715395c55e.poster.avif?t=1713576050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/f0fc22bbab0d20f8a64dff715395c55e.webm?t=1713576050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/f0fc22bbab0d20f8a64dff715395c55e.mp4?t=1713576050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chapter 1 in an episodic series. </li><li> Progress through unique areas in a shifting world. </li><li> 3D Platforming Gameplay </li><li> Item based escape room style puzzles. </li><li> Mid - Nineties Aesthetic  </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/e29bab3137188f5ffc9fa6b26ddc5e99.avif?t=1713576050\" /></span><br><br>You always wanted to be a contestant on the hit kids game show &quot;Jungle Jammers&quot;. <br>You've practiced for months.<br>You've learned all the tricks.<br>You've sent in dozens of applications.<br>But you've never been picked.<br><br>Lucky for you, Funset Studios has opened their Studio tour to the public. <br>You're finally going to get the chance to meet your favorite TV Character: Fumbo The Hippo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/f0fc22bbab0d20f8a64dff715395c55e.poster.avif?t=1713576050\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/f0fc22bbab0d20f8a64dff715395c55e.webm?t=1713576050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557330/extras/f0fc22bbab0d20f8a64dff715395c55e.mp4?t=1713576050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chapter 1 in an episodic series. </li><li> Progress through unique areas in a shifting world. </li><li> 3D Platforming Gameplay </li><li> Item based escape room style puzzles. </li><li> Mid - Nineties Aesthetic  </li></ul>",
